  <string name="DELETE_ACCOUNT_LEGAL_TEXT">
    <en>Tap the Delete button below to delete your account in C.A.T.S and erase all of your personal data that is affiliated with this account. You will lose your progress and achievements in the game. You will also lose any in-app purchases you may have made and we will not be able to refund you. Once you delete your account, the process cannot be undone. Account deletion can take up to 1 day.</en>
