  <string name="CHINA_AGE_RATING_DETAILS">
    <en>1. This game is a multiplayer online robot shooting battle game suitable for users aged 12 and above. Minors are advised to use the game under parental supervision.

2. In the game, players choose and combine different mechs, encouraging strategic decision-making based on various battle scenarios to improve their strength. Players expand and control their territory by destroying other robots. The game does not include a text-based stranger social system, and all other social systems are managed in accordance with relevant laws and regulations.

3. In accordance with national regulations, the game includes a real-name verification system. Users who have not completed real-name verification cannot enter the game. Verified minor users may only access the game between 20:00 and 21:00 on Fridays, Saturdays, Sundays, and statutory holidays.

Some gameplay features and items in the game require payment. Verified minor users are subject to the following restrictions:
- Users under the age of 8 cannot make payments.
- Users aged 8 and above but under 16 may not spend more than 50 RMB per transaction or more than 200 RMB per month in total.
- Users aged 16 and above but under 18 may not spend more than 100 RMB per transaction or more than 400 RMB per month in total.

4. This game focuses on robot shooting battles. By selecting different mech weapons and planning strategies and tactics, players can develop strategic thinking and combination skills. Intense battles require players to stay focused while controlling mechs, helping improve concentration. Different scenarios and battle modes encourage players to think proactively and achieve objectives through all-around strategic planning.</en>
